       "The Election Commission (324) — free-fair elections; the CEC + 2 commissioners.",
       "Electoral reforms — EVM (1982–2004), NOTA (2013), VVPAT, the model code of conduct.",
       "Voters — 18 years (61st Amendment, 1988); 96 crore+ (2024).",
       "Reservation — for SC/ST in the Lok Sabha-assemblies; delimitation.",
       "Election disputes — the Representation of the People Act (1951); High Courts.",
       "Measuring democracy — polling %, peaceful power transfer."
